msgid "STM32G474RET6 / MB1367 selected peripheral platform"
msgstr "STM32G474RET6／MB1367 选定外设平台"

msgid ""
"This is a source-reviewed STM32G474RET6 baseline for NUCLEO-G474RE. It "
"implements CPU startup, a fixed clock transaction, TIM2 time, package-valid "
"GPIO on A/B/C/D/F/G, six UART IRQ byte controllers, SPI1/2 finite polling, "
"TIM3/4 CH1 fixed-base PWM, independent IWDG and PA0/PA1 EXTI edge events. It "
"does not establish Flash programming, DMA, ADC, I2C, FDCAN, USB, Ethernet, "
"low-power continuity or other G4 peripheral support. Unsupported modes must "
"fail the configuration resolver. Actual PCB inspection and all HIL remain not"
" executed."
msgstr ""
"这是 NUCLEO-G474RE 上经源码审阅的 STM32G474RET6 基线，实现 CPU startup、固定时钟事务、TIM2 "
"时间、A/B/C/D/F/G 封装有效 GPIO、六个 UART IRQ 字节控制器、SPI1/2 有限 polling、TIM3/4 CH1 固定 "
"base PWM、独立 IWDG 和 PA0/PA1 EXTI 边沿事件。不建立 Flash "
"编程、DMA、ADC、I2C、FDCAN、USB、Ethernet、低功耗连续性或其他 G4 外设支持。不支持的模式必须在配置解析时失败。真实 PCB "
"检查与全部 HIL 均未执行。"

