msgid "Actual bridge and ST-LINK connection"
msgstr "真实焊桥与 ST-LINK 连接"

msgid ""
"The alternate ST-LINK MCO 8 MHz clock wiring needs a different reviewed "
"profile and is not accepted here. The VCP route is LPUART1, not USART2. "
"Source review does not prove physical electrical states, UART reception, "
"board power or oscillator frequency. Private PCB data and bridge policy stay "
"outside the platform."
msgstr ""
"替代 ST-LINK MCO 8 MHz 接线需另一已审 profile，本配置不接纳。VCP 是 LPUART1，不是 "
"USART2。源码审查不能证明实际电气状态、UART 接收、板级供电或晶振频率。私有 PCB 与焊桥策略留在平台之外。"

msgid "Clock transaction and rollback"
msgstr "时钟事务与回滚"

msgid ""
"Admission requires privileged task context, incoming masks clear, positive "
"phase poll budget, reset-like HSI16 selected, PLL/HSE idle and reserved "
"TIM2/NVIC unused. Unknown active resources are rejected before effects. A "
"poll count bounds work; it is not an elapsed-time deadline while the timebase"
" is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"准入要求特权任务、进入掩码全清、正数 phase poll budget、近似复位 HSI16 已选、PLL/HSE idle 及预留 TIM2/NVIC"
" 未用。未知活动资源在效果前拒绝。Poll count 限制工作量；timebase 不可用时它不是经过时间 deadline。"

msgid ""
"The reviewed profile is HSE 24 / PLLM 6 / PLLN 85 / PLLR 2 = 170 MHz. PLL "
"input is 4 MHz and VCO 340 MHz, inside the datasheet limits. HCLK/APB1/APB2 "
"and the TIM2 kernel clock are 170 MHz. G4 uses SW_HSI=1 and SW_PLL=3; F4 "
"clock encodings are not reused."
msgstr ""
"已审 profile 为 HSE 24 / PLLM 6 / PLLN 85 / PLLR 2 = 170 MHz。PLL 输入 4 MHz、VCO "
"340 MHz，满足数据手册。HCLK/APB1/APB2 和 TIM2 kernel clock 均 170 MHz。G4 使用 "
"SW_HSI=1、SW_PLL=3，不复用 F4 编码。"

msgid ""
"Startup acquires PWREN with readback and a barrier before reading PWR state. "
"It selects voltage range 1, waits for VOSF clear, uses boost mode and four "
"Flash wait states, starts and observes HSE/PLL, switches through AHB/2 (85 "
"MHz), waits at least the required transition interval, then selects AHB/1. "
"The actual M4 object contains 85 dependent SUBS/BNE iterations at verified 85"
" MHz. At least 170 instructions/core cycles gives a conservative 2 "
"microsecond lower bound; IRQs can extend it. Physical timing remains "
"unmeasured. Volatile accesses, readback and ordering barriers cannot be "
"optimized away."
msgstr ""
"Startup 取得 PWREN 并读回、执行屏障后读取 PWR；选择 voltage range 1，等待 VOSF clear，使用 boost "
"与四个 Flash wait state，启动并观察 HSE/PLL，经 AHB/2（85 MHz）切换，等待至少规定转换间隔，再选 AHB/1。真实 "
"M4 对象包含已校验 85 MHz 下 85 次依赖 SUBS/BNE；至少 170 指令／core cycle 给出保守 2 微秒下限，IRQ "
"可延长。物理时序未测。Volatile、读回及排序屏障不能优化掉。"

msgid ""
"Failure records the primary result, cleanup result and still-owned effects. "
"Rollback restores observed HSI before disabling PLL/HSE or reducing "
"Flash/voltage settings. TIM2 source withdrawal and NVIC proof precede "
"removing its ownership. Failed rollback retains the resource bits for "
"explicit retry; it never reports successful cleanup or publishes usable I/O. "
"Stop requires every external peripheral/task consumer already joined; no "
"hidden coordinator guesses this."
msgstr ""
"失败记录 primary、cleanup 和仍持有效果。回滚在关闭 PLL/HSE 或降低 Flash／电压前恢复已观察 HSI。撤销 TIM2 "
"所有权前先证明 source withdrawal 和 NVIC。回滚失败保留资源位供显式重试，绝不报告虚构清理成功或发布可用 I/O。Stop "
"要求外部全部外设／任务消费者已 join；无隐藏协调者猜测。"

msgid "Time, GPIO and serial contracts"
msgstr "时间、GPIO 与串口合同"

msgid ""
"TIM2 is reserved: 32-bit count, prescaler 169, ARR 0xffffffff, 1 MHz, "
"overflow IRQ priority0 with no OS API. Snapshot saves/restores interrupt "
"state and corrects one pending overflow; IRQ must run at least once per 2^32 "
"microseconds. NMI, HardFault, dynamic reclocking and deep sleep are outside "
"this time contract."
msgstr ""
"TIM2 被预留：32 位 count、prescaler 169、ARR 0xffffffff、1 MHz、overflow IRQ priority0"
" 且无 OS API。快照保存／恢复中断状态并修正一次 pending overflow；IRQ 至少每 2^32 "
"微秒执行一次。NMI、HardFault、动态调频与深睡不在此 time 合同内。"

msgid ""
"GPIO initialization preloads BSRR and observes ODR before exposing a mode. It"
" observes push/pull and pull configuration, then the selected MODER bits. "
"Partial failure retains the instance for an explicit inactive-level rollback."
" Hot writes use BSRR directly. Toggle requires the single-owner serialization"
" contract."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 初始化先预装 BSRR 并观察 ODR，再开放 mode；观察 push/pull 和 pull 配置，然后所选 "
"MODER。部分失败保留实例供显式 inactive-level 回滚。热写直接 BSRR。Toggle 要求单 owner 串行合同。"

msgid ""
"The RE package inventory has 52 pads across A/B/C/D/F/G; missing pads and "
"GPIOE are rejected. Inventory does not establish a Board connector or "
"electrical route. PF0/PF1 remain reserved by the fixed HSE profile and PG10 "
"by the unchanged NRST option. GPIO admission cannot silently repurpose those "
"pads."
msgstr ""
"RE 封装清单在 A/B/C/D/F/G 上包含 52 个焊盘；缺失焊盘与 GPIOE 均拒绝。清单不建立 Board 连接器或电气路线。固定 HSE "
"配置保留 PF0/PF1，保持不变的 NRST 选项保留 PG10。GPIO 准入不能静默改变这些焊盘的用途。"

msgid ""
"LPUART1 supports caller-owned byte rings and one borrowed TX request. Its "
"actual 20-bit BRR is round(256*PCLK/(16*baud)), range0x300..0xfffff; 115200 "
"at 170 MHz uses PRESC=16 (register7), BRR 23611. Initialization observes "
"TEACK/REACK before publishing the face. IRQ is bounded to one TX byte and one"
" RX byte, reports aggregate corruption/overflow loss and preserves older ring"
" contents. It does not reuse F4's USART divisor, register offsets or error-"
"clear sequences."
msgstr ""
"LPUART1 支持调用方 byte ring 与一个借用 TX request。真实 20 位 BRR 为 "
"round(256*PCLK/(16*baud))，范围 0x300..0xfffff；170 MHz、115200 使用 "
"PRESC=16（寄存器7）、BRR 23611。发布接口前观察 TEACK/REACK。IRQ 有界为一个 TX byte 和一个 RX "
"byte，报告聚合 corruption/overflow loss 并保留旧环内容，不复用 F4 USART 分频、offset 或错误清除序列。"

msgid ""
"USART1/2/3 and UART4/5 use the same IRQ-byte ownership contract through "
"separate static contexts and exact gates, IRQs and pin routes. They use "
"PRESC=1 and OVER16 with their own BRR calculation; LPUART's 20-bit divisor "
"and PRESC=16 are not reused. The configured 170 MHz bus/kernel profile is "
"observed before admission. Chip-valid routes do not imply that those signals "
"reach the default NUCLEO VCP or any populated connector."
msgstr ""
"USART1/2/3 与 UART4/5 通过独立静态上下文及精确的 gate、IRQ 和引脚路线，采用相同的 IRQ 字节所有权合同。它们使用 "
"PRESC=1、OVER16 和独立 BRR 计算；不复用 LPUART 的 20 位除数或 PRESC=16。准入前观察已配置的 170 MHz "
"总线/内核时钟。芯片有效的路线不表示对应信号连接默认 NUCLEO VCP 或已装配连接器。"

msgid ""
"TXE proves a register can accept a byte; TC proves the final wire byte "
"completed. Request metadata/payload/ring/private registers/wake target cannot"
" overlap. Cancel and timeout disable new sends, then wait for actual wire "
"completion. Failed drain retains QUARANTINED storage; later hardware proof "
"can settle it. The provider detaches its active pointer and interrupt sources"
" before SETTLED, which is its final request access. Cold stop closes "
"admission, joins captured callbacks, observes UE and TEACK/REACK off, "
"disables/clears/readbacks NVIC, then withdraws ring/wake ownership. FreeRTOS-"
"capable sinks require actual priority and priority-group validation; waking "
"does not start a scheduler."
msgstr ""
"TXE 证明寄存器可接收字节，TC 证明末字节线侧完成。Request metadata/payload/ring/private "
"registers/wake target 不重叠。Cancel／timeout 禁止新发送，等待真实线侧完成。排空失败保留 QUARANTINED "
"存储，后续硬件证明可最终完成并排空。提供者先解除 active 指针和中断源，最后发布 SETTLED；此发布是其对请求的最终访问。Cold stop "
"关闭准入、join 已捕获回调、观察 UE 与 TEACK/REACK 关闭、关闭／清除／读回 NVIC，再解除 ring/wake 所有权。支持 "
"FreeRTOS 的 sink 要求真实 priority/group 校验；wake 不启动 scheduler。"

msgid "Finite SPI, fixed PWM and irreversible watchdog"
msgstr "有限 SPI、固定 PWM 与不可逆看门狗"

msgid ""
"SPI1 and SPI2 implement eight-bit full-duplex polling with modes 0..3, "
"explicit active-low GPIO CS, finite absolute deadlines and at most 256 bytes "
"per call. The G4 FIFO uses DS=7, FRXTH and byte accesses to DR. At the fixed "
"170 MHz kernel clock, requested SCK is limited to 42.5 MHz: the divide-by-two"
" rate of 85 MHz exceeds DS12288 Table89. The divider rounds toward a rate no "
"faster than the endpoint request. SPI/PWM alternate outputs select "
"OSPEEDR=11, matching the SPI table's stated output-speed condition; UART "
"keeps its separate policy. DMA and asynchronous SPI are unsupported."
msgstr ""
"SPI1 和 SPI2 实现八位全双工 polling，支持模式 0..3、明确的低有效 GPIO CS、有限绝对 deadline，每次调用最多传输 "
"256 字节。G4 FIFO 使用 DS=7、FRXTH 和 DR 字节访问。固定 170 MHz 内核时钟下，请求 SCK 限制为 42.5 "
"MHz：二分频的 85 MHz 超过 DS12288 Table89。分频选择确保实际速率不高于端点请求。SPI/PWM 复用输出选择 "
"OSPEEDR=11，匹配 SPI 表规定的输出速率条件；UART 保留独立策略。不支持 DMA 与异步 SPI。"

msgid ""
"Transfer completion observes the receive path and empty/idle shifter state. "
"Timeout or hardware error faults the port and attempts bounded reset. Both "
"reset edges and idle state require readback. An accepted polling call cannot "
"return before wire drain and inactive CS are proved. Failed reset or CS proof"
" retains the executor, caller buffers and all controller/CS owners, masks "
"IRQs and invokes the fault observer; it parks if that observer returns. "
"Product terminal recovery remains external. Idle stop/recovery failures "
"retain their separate retryable private leases. Output buffers and transfer "
"counts cannot alias owned state or MMIO, including the RCC reset register. "
"Generated cleanup retains clocks and pin leases until the port and its CS "
"endpoints have stopped."
msgstr ""
"传输完成需要观察接收路径及移位器为空/空闲状态。超时或硬件错误使端口进入故障并尝试有界 reset。reset 两个边沿及空闲状态均需回读。已接受的 "
"polling 调用在证明移位器排空且 CS 无效前不能返回。reset 或 CS 证明失败时，保留执行者、调用者缓冲及所有控制器/CS 所有者，屏蔽 "
"IRQ 并调用故障观察者；观察者返回后停驻。产品终止恢复保持外置。空闲 stop/recovery "
"失败仍保留各自可重试私有租约。输出缓冲与传输计数不能别名覆盖已拥有状态或 MMIO，包括 RCC reset 寄存器。生成的清理逻辑在端口及其 CS "
"端点停止前保留时钟和引脚租约。"

msgid ""
"The independent IWDG is optional and is not enabled by Platform startup. A "
"successful nominal timeout configuration uses the DS12288 Table45 LSI "
"envelope of 29.5..34 kHz under its stated conditions. The provider rejects a "
"windowed configuration and busy shadow updates before activation, observes "
"hardware option activation, and returns unknown bounds while automatic shadow"
" updates remain busy. It reports actual debug freeze state. A failed "
"preactivation LSI or debug rollback retains a retryable stop lease. Once CCCC"
" is issued, activation is irreversible even if programming fails; a running "
"watchdog keeps Platform stop from claiming complete withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"独立 IWDG 是可选能力，Platform startup 不会启用。成功的标称超时配置使用 DS12288 Table45 在其规定条件下的 "
"29.5..34 kHz LSI 包络。provider 在激活前拒绝 window 配置及忙碌的 shadow 更新，观察硬件选项激活，并在自动 "
"shadow 更新仍忙时返回未知边界。它报告实际 debug freeze 状态。激活前 LSI 或 debug 回滚失败会保留可供 stop "
"重试的租约。发出 CCCC 后激活不可逆，即使编程失败也不例外；运行中的看门狗阻止 Platform stop 声称已完全撤回。"

msgid ""
"TIM3 CH1 PA6 AF2 and TIM4 CH1 PB6 AF2 provide independent, exclusive whole-"
"controller PWM. The reviewed base is edge-aligned upcounting and active-high,"
" with tick clock 170 MHz divided by an integer 1..65536, period 1..65535 and "
"duty 0..period. Duty uses CCR preload; a call does not imply an immediate "
"electrical change. Zero and full duty are explicit constant levels. Runtime "
"period/base changes, other channels, complementary outputs, capture, break, "
"IRQ and DMA are unsupported. Start establishes a quiet UG epoch before "
"exposing AF/output/CEN. Stop observes channel/counter withdrawal and the "
"Board inactive GPIO level; failed close retains clocks, pin state and cleanup"
" duty."
msgstr ""
"TIM3 CH1 PA6 AF2 与 TIM4 CH1 PB6 AF2 提供独立、独占整个控制器的 PWM。受审 base "
"为边沿对齐、向上计数、有效高电平，tick 时钟为 170 MHz 除以整数 1..65536，period 为 1..65535，duty 为 "
"0..period。Duty 使用 CCR preload；调用不表示电气变化立即生效。零和满 duty 是明确的恒定电平。不支持运行时 "
"period/base 变化、其他 channel、互补输出、capture、break、IRQ 或 DMA。Start 在暴露 "
"AF/output/CEN 前建立安静的 UG 时间起点。Stop 观察 channel/counter 撤回及 Board 无效 GPIO "
"电平；close 失败保留时钟、引脚状态与清理责任。"

msgid ""
"These count limits describe the timer's logical capability. For example, 170 "
"MHz tick and period two generate an 85 MHz logical waveform; they do not "
"prove that an attached pad/load can reproduce it. DS12288 Table56 gives the "
"following conditional limits for OSPEEDR=11 and 30 pF load:"
msgstr ""
"这些计数限制描述 timer 的逻辑能力。例如，170 MHz tick 和 period 二产生 85 MHz "
"逻辑波形；这不能证明附加引脚和负载能复现该波形。DS12288 Table56 对 OSPEEDR=11、30 pF 负载给出以下条件限制："

msgid "GPIO supply condition"
msgstr "GPIO 供电条件"

msgid "Datasheet maximum pad toggling frequency"
msgstr "数据手册最大引脚翻转频率"

msgid "VDD 1.62..2.7 V"
msgstr "VDD 1.62..2.7 V"

msgid "50 MHz"
msgstr "50 MHz"

msgid "VDD 2.7..3.6 V"
msgstr "VDD 2.7..3.6 V"

msgid "120 MHz"
msgstr "120 MHz"

msgid ""
"The fixed clock profile does not establish actual GPIO supply or load. A "
"Board must qualify its voltage, capacitance, pulse width and electrical path "
"before using the corresponding rate. No unconditional 85 MHz pad performance "
"or electrical safety is claimed by the software counter range."
msgstr ""
"固定时钟配置不建立实际 GPIO 供电或负载。使用对应速率前，Board 必须验证电压、电容、脉宽及电气路径。软件计数范围不声称无条件的 85 MHz "
"引脚性能或电气安全。"

msgid ""
"The [mainstream adaptation contract](mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md) describes "
"cross-family differences, source identities and the separate software/HIL "
"acceptance boundary. No G4 extension inherits F407 or another G4 part's "
"physical qualification."
msgstr ""
"[主流接入合同](mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md)说明跨系列差异、来源身份及独立的软件/HIL 验收边界。任何 G4 "
"扩展都不继承 F407 或其他 G4 料号的物理资格。"

msgid "Software evidence and outstanding qualification"
msgstr "软件证据与剩余资格"

msgid "Exact EXTI extension"
msgstr "精确 EXTI 扩展"

msgid ""
"`EXTI0`/PA0 and `EXTI1`/PA1 use independent IRQ6/7 with explicit priority and"
" caller-selected 1..4096 event slots. RM0440 Rev9 section10.2.3 pp367–368 "
"gives the GPIOA zero encoding of each `SYSCFG_EXTICR1` field; "
"sections15.3–15.5 pp441–453 describe interrupt selection and W1C `EXTI_PR1`. "
"The official CMSIS layout and exact-part package inventory supply the "
"register and pin facts. `tests/contracts/g474_assembly/exti_board` is only a "
"software fixture; it does not assert an actual NUCLEO button, connector, bias"
" resistor or electrical route."
msgstr ""
"`EXTI0`/PA0 与 `EXTI1`/PA1 使用独立 IRQ6/7、显式优先级和调用方选定 1..4096 事件槽。RM0440 Rev9 "
"10.2.3 节 367–368 页给出 `SYSCFG_EXTICR1` GPIOA 零编码；15.3–15.5 节 441–453 页说明中断选择与 "
"W1C `EXTI_PR1`。官方 CMSIS "
"布局与精确料号封装清单提供寄存器／引脚事实。`tests/contracts/g474_assembly/exti_board` 仅为软件夹具，不声明真实"
" NUCLEO button、connector、bias resistor 或电气路由。"

msgid ""
"The common `edge-event` face has a single task reader and one IRQ producer "
"per line. Each invocation acknowledges one selected pending bit, samples at "
"most one level and records one timebase timestamp. Hardware edges may "
"coalesce; both-edge direction reflects the sampled level. No polling loop "
"reconstructs lost edges. A full ring preserves older events, exposes a "
"separate loss boundary and only then admits later events. CPU exclusion per "
"copied event is bounded; read work scales with the explicit caller capacity."
msgstr ""
"公共 `edge-event` 接口每条线有唯一任务 reader 和 IRQ producer。每次确认一个所选 pending bit，最多采样一个 "
"level 并记录一个 timebase timestamp。硬件边沿可合并，双边沿方向反映采样 level；没有轮询重建丢边沿。满环保留旧事件、开放独立"
" loss 边界，然后才接纳后续事件。每次复制事件的 CPU 排他有界；read 工作随显式调用方容量增长。"

msgid ""
"Platform admission checks line masks, triggers, pending and NVIC before "
"changing global clocks or GPIO. A shared SYSCFG gate has one generated owner "
"and retains a preexisting enable. Each line saves its mux nibble and restores"
" only that field after its own sources and independent vector are observed "
"withdrawn. GPIO cold leases restore the original input/analog state at "
"complete Platform stop. A failed cleanup keeps storage and recovery "
"responsibility. Wake binding checks actual IRQ policy and joins captured "
"callbacks before releasing storage. No public API, dynamic allocation, "
"worker, runtime registry or extra OS layer is introduced."
msgstr ""
"平台准入在改变全局时钟或 GPIO 前检查 line mask、trigger、pending 与 NVIC。共享 SYSCFG gate 只有一个生成 "
"owner，保留先前 enable。每条线保存 mux nibble，仅在自身 source 和独立 vector 撤销后恢复该字段。完整 "
"Platform stop 时 GPIO cold lease 恢复原 input/analog。清理失败保留 storage 和 recovery "
"责任。Wake 绑定检查实际 IRQ policy，在释放 storage 前 join 捕获回调。不引入新公共 API、动态分配、worker、运行时 "
"registry 或额外 OS 层。"

msgid ""
"The two authored EXTI fixtures select baremetal/FreeRTOS and exact three/two "
"event capacities. Native GoogleTest/GoogleMock executes the real provider and"
" generated two-line factory; ARM fixtures retain the selected ops/handlers "
"and actual FreeRTOS graph. Empty and existing GPIO/LPUART fixtures remain "
"separate regressions. Physical HIL remains `not_executed`: a future admitted "
"station must confirm PA0/PA1 accessibility and bias, inject observed edges, "
"compare instrument counts/waveforms with coalesced/loss semantics, measure "
"IRQ latency and prove source withdrawal before storage reuse. Software "
"success is not that evidence."
msgstr ""
"两份作者 EXTI 夹具选择 baremetal／FreeRTOS 及精确三／二事件容量。Native GoogleTest/GoogleMock "
"执行真实 provider 与生成双线 factory；ARM 保留 selected ops/handler 和真实 FreeRTOS 图。Empty "
"与既有 GPIO/LPUART 保持独立回归。物理 HIL 保持 `not_executed`：未来准入工位须确认 PA0/PA1 可接入性及 "
"bias，注入观察边沿，对比仪器计数／波形与 coalesced/loss 语义，测 IRQ 延迟并证明 storage 复用前 source "
"withdrawal。软件成功不是该证据。"

msgid "Existing baseline evidence"
msgstr "既有基线证据"

msgid ""
"Actual host models execute the production register algorithm with official "
"SDK layout and masks. They verify bounded timeout, failed rollback, initial-"
"latch failure, source withdrawal, request alias rejection, wire drain, "
"overflow, callback borrow and independent state. They do not establish "
"oscillator, voltage, timing, peripheral errata or physical IRQ behavior."
msgstr ""
"真实 host model 以官方 SDK layout/mask 执行生产寄存器算法，验证有界 timeout、回滚失败、初始 latch "
"失败、source withdrawal、request alias 拒绝、wire drain、overflow、callback borrow 与独立"
" state；不建立 oscillator、voltage、timing、peripheral errata 或物理 IRQ。"

msgid ""
"The earlier baseline ARM C11 build with GCC 14.3 and the pinned official GCC "
"startup links empty, LED, UART and mixed bare-metal ELFs. The selected types "
"occupy System 56, GPIO 12, UART 72 and TX request 32 bytes. The small profile"
" costs are measured from those baseline ELF files and include the 2048-byte "
"MSP reservation; they are not inferred from host sizeof or a size promise for"
" the expanded modes. Current resource and qualification records must bind "
"their exact selected configuration. Unselected GPIO/UART symbols disappear "
"through section GC."
msgstr ""
"早期基线使用 GCC 14.3、ARM C11 和锁定的官方 GCC startup，链接 empty、LED、UART 和 mixed bare-"
"metal ELF。选定类型大小为 System 56、GPIO 12、UART 72、TX request 32 字节。小型配置成本从这些基线 ELF "
"测得，包含 2048 字节 MSP 预留；不是主机 sizeof 推断，也不是扩展模式的大小承诺。当前资源和资格记录必须绑定各自精确配置。未选中的 "
"GPIO/UART 符号通过 section GC 消除。"

msgid ""
"Generated typed factories, both OS backend compositions, clean reproducible "
"builds, exact SDK lock/bundle identities and any later Board HIL have "
"separate qualification exits. Software-only delivery must keep physical "
"status unknown."
msgstr ""
"生成类型化 factory、两种 OS 后端组合、clean 可复现构建、精确 SDK lock/bundle 身份与未来 Board HIL "
"都有独立资格退出条件。纯软件交付须保持物理状态 unknown。"
